  "speechText": "Basically, I retry only temporary failures, such as a timeout or a temporary network error. I set a retry limit and use exponential backoff, so each retry waits a little longer. For invalid input, permission errors, or bad configuration, I fail fast and do not retry. If the operation can create duplicate data, I also make it idempotent.",
